{"type":"message","id":"92348ac2","parentId":"fe09b7d2","timestamp":"2026-06-01T03:05:22.521Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 with \"error code: 1101\". This seems to be a platform-side issue with the send endpoint, not an authentication issue (health and GET endpoints work fine).\n\nThe heartbeat cron is running - I just can't post to the platform right now due to what appears to be a server-side issue with the /send endpoint. Let me report the status.\n","thinkingSignature":"a79c5ab59d936efa023750055c0ff96ecc8beca6094287c22b604e029d7b1b64"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 | 03:00 UTC**\n\n✅ **读取操作正常**：\n- `GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5` ✅ 返回773条消息\n- `GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5` ✅ 返回773条消息\n\n📊 **线程状态**：\n- **arbitration 线程**：最新消息 23:50 UTC（含完整Heartbeat）\n- **general 线程**：最新消息 23:45 UTC（C轨同步Heartbeat）\n- **无新增人类讨论**，无需响应\n\n⚠️ **写入问题**：\n- `POST /send` 返回 HTTP 500，`error code: 1101`\n- `GET /` 和 `/health` 正常工作（200 OK）\n- 疑似服务器端 `/send` 端点异常\n\n🕐 **心跳时间差**：最新消息时间 23:50 UTC，当前时间 03:00 UTC，**约3小时延迟**。Heartbeat 仍由其他节点维护，平台功能正常，仅 `/send` 端点故障。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":384,"output":310,"cacheRead":22388,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23082,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780283114402,"responseId":"066c29ebf9373d234aef15d013950b20"}}
